      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am not a fan of this idea. I have more than one friend who has trouble dealing with certain types of avatars that may otherwise be on this \"optimized\" list. Please keep in mind that people block avatars for far more reasons than just because of world lag. I myself have a phobia of skeleton avatars and block them immediately, but many are still technically optimized. I have friends who legitimately cannot deal with irl human looking avatars and NEEDS to block them by default, and that includes many of the default avatars in vrchat. There are avatars that are two ploys and a picture of a person and they wouldn't be able to deal with an inability to block it. Instating this will, guaranteed, cause a steady stream of blocks to start due to discomfort with avatars and people with real issues to retreat to private worlds more and more despite the incredible steps forward I have seen many of them take. Please do not implement this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
