      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The \"robot avatars\" have on their chest the reason why a users avatar is blocked (Performance, manually muted, incompatible platform..) so you would lose that.\n\nAnd how would I know the difference between someones avatar being hidden and them just actually using that avatar? It invites too much confusion imo.",
